{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ptkh9z","slideIndex":9,"text":"A professor is lending us the lab this week, and we plan to take IMU measurements. An IMU tracks movement and orientation; it does not measure force. Our future product goal is to add sensors and alerts for defined risk conditions. The alert rules and any risk reduction still need to be designed and tested. P2.04 remains a CAD pre-design, and the planned session is not a completed validation."}